      "rows": [
        [
          null,
          "Breach\nIn the Consolidation Step of this model’s\nActivation, it suffers 1 Damage for each Breach\ntoken it has.\nIf the model is Crippled, this Damage is\ninflicted as Critical Damage, as normal; if\nthis causes a further Breach (or a Hazard),\nit is not resolved until the model’s next\nConsolidation Step."
        ],
        [
          null,
          "Structural Failure\nThe model’s Armour rating has a -1 Modifier\nfor each Structural Failure token it has."
        ],
        [
          null,
          "Hazard\nIn the Consolidation Step of this model’s\nActivation, it gains 1 level of Disorder for each\nHazard token it has.\nIn addition, a model with a Hazard token\ncannot Rally."
        ],
        [
          null,
          "Shredded Defences\nThe model’s Defences rating has a -2 Modifier\nfor each Shredded Defences token it has."
        ],
        [
          null,
          "Navigation Lock\nWhile a model has at least one Navigation Lock\ntoken, it cannot Come About or engage Full\nReverse."
        ],
        [
          null,
          "System Failure\nWhile a model has at least one System Failure\ntoken, all of its Systems are negated, and it is\nnot affected by any Unit Benefits provided by\nSystems on other models."
        ]
      ],
